{"vid": [{"id": "vid", "headword": "विद्", "headword_slp1": "vid", "fold": "vid", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "vaidya", "senses": [{"gloss": "विद् (I) vt. 2P (pp. विदित; pres. वेत्ति, वेद; desid. विविदिषति) 1. To know, to learn, to find out, to be aware of, यो न वेत्त्यभिवादस्य विप्रः प्रत्यभिवादनम् M.ii.126, अथ तु वेत्सि शुचिव्रतमात्मनः Sak.v., Na.xxii.55, Bt.xiv.49; 2. to look upon, to regard as, to take for, to consider, अविनाशि तु तद्विद्धि Bg.ii.17, एतस्मान्मां कुशलिनमभिज्ञानदानाद्विदित्वा Megh.ii.49.With सम्-, (Atm.) 1. to recognize; 2. to know, to be aware of.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "विद् (II) vi. 4Ā (pres. विद्यते) To be, to exist, नासतो विद्यते भावो नाभावो विद्यते सतः Bg.ii.16. (The root is used in many of the senses of अस् II q.v.)", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "विद् (III) vt. 6U (pp. वित्त; pres. विंदति-ते) 1. To discover, to find, विन्दन्ति मार्गं नखरंध्रमुक्तैर्मुक्ताफलैः केसरिणां किराताः K.S.i.6; 2. to get, to obtain, to acquire, एकमप्यास्थितः सम्यगुभयोर्विन्दते फलम् Bg.v.4; 3. to experience, R.xiv.56; 4. to marry, to take in marriage.With अनु-, to experience, to feel, विन्दति चंदनमिन्दुकिरणमनुविंदति खेदमधीरम् Git.G.iv.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "विद् (IV) vt. 7Ā (pp. वित्त or विन्न; pres. विंते) 1. To know, to understand; 2. to regard, to take for, न नृणेह्यीति लोकोयं विंत्ते मां निष्पराक्रमम् Bt.vi.39; 3. to investigate, to discuss.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "विद् (V) vt. or vi. 10Ā (pres. वेदयते) 1. To announce, to make known, to tell, to narrate; 2. to feel, to experience; 3. to dwell, to live.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "विद् Caus. (वेदयति-ते) to make known, to inform, to expound, e.g. वेदार्थं स्वानवेदयत्.With आ-, 1. to tell, to communicate, K.S.vi.21, R.xii.55; 2. to show, to exhibit, आवेदयति नितांतं क्षेत्रियरोगं सखि हृदंतः K.Pr.x.With नि-, 1. to communicate, to tell, to narrate, (with a dat.); 2. to announce, कथमिदानीमात्मानं निवेदयामि कथं वात्मापहारं करोमि Sak.i.; 3. to present, to make an offering, M.ii.51; 4. to commit to the care of, to put in the hands of.With प्रति-, to inform.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "विद् (I) m. 1. The planet Mercury; 2. a learned man, a paṇḍit.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "विद् (II) f. Knowledge, understanding.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "vida": [{"id": "vida", "headword": "विद", "headword_slp1": "vida", "fold": "vida", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "vaidya", "senses": [{"gloss": "विद m. 1. A learned man, a paṇḍit; 2. the planet Mercury.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["विदः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["vidaH"]}, {"id": "vidA", "headword": "विदा", "headword_slp1": "vidA", "fold": "vida", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "vaidya", "senses": [{"gloss": "विदा f. Knowledge, learning.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "vidansa": [{"id": "vidaMSa", "headword": "विदंश", "headword_slp1": "vidaMSa", "fold": "vidansa", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "vaidya", "senses": [{"gloss": "विदंश m. Pungent food that excites thirst.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["विदंशः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["vidaMSaH"]}], "vidagDa": [{"id": "vidagDa", "headword": "विदग्ध", "headword_slp1": "vidagDa", "fold": "vidagDa", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "vaidya", "senses": [{"gloss": "विदग्ध (I) a. (f. ग्धा) 1. Burnt up; 2. digested; 3. shrewd, clever; 4. crafty, artful.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "विदग्ध (II) m. 1. A learned man; 2. a paṇḍit; 3. a libertine.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["विदग्धः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["vidagDaH"]}, {"id": "vidagDA", "headword": "विदग्धा", "headword_slp1": "vidagDA", "fold": "vidagDa", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "vaidya", "senses": [{"gloss": "विदग्ध (I) a. (f. ग्धा) 1. Burnt up; 2. digested; 3. shrewd, clever; 4. crafty, artful.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "विदग्धा f. A shrewd and artful woman.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "vidaTa": [{"id": "vidaTa", "headword": "विदथ", "headword_slp1": "vidaTa", "fold": "vidaTa", "headword_lang